Yep, that's the effect of confused genocide.  Amnesia is another bad scroll
to read, regardless of your mental state.  Confused create monster generates
a whole lot of acid blobs.  Etc.  Confusion does not mean safe scroll
reading!

To identify scrolls, the best option is to use shops to figure out roughly
how much they cost.  Charging, Genocide, Stinking Cloud, and Punishment all
cost the same, for instance, so if you find something with that price, you
know it's one of those four.  And knowing that confused geno is bad (and
that confusion doesn't protect against punishment, etc.) your best bet is to
bless it before reading.  Blessed charging is very useful; blessed geno is
great; blessed stinking cloud can be useful; and blessed punishment just
makes you feel guilty--no other effect.  There are similar patterns for the
scrolls in other price groups; play around to find them, or go back to the
spoilers (since you mention having read them already).

